  "notes": ["Small: at most 3 files, at most 200 lines and one slice. Parallel: 2 or more independent slices and either 4 or more files or 1,500 or more lines (src/config.ts TRIAGE).", "The fifth fact, code (the task changes source, tests, build or CI configuration in a repository), is not read by the policy in src/triage.ts decide() (src/triage.ts:12-17). Callers use it to decide whether git machinery (worktrees, checkpoint commits, the integrator) is used and, in npm run auto, whether web tools are allowed (scripts/auto.sh); the test gate decides from the changed files, not from code (.claude/hooks/verify.sh)."]
